OL,3,GNEWSAPill on a string could detect
OL,4,Acancer risk in people with heartburn
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople with chronic heartburn are being
OL,7,Foffered a test that can help to detect
OL,8,Ftheir risk of developing cancer.
OL,10,FThe pill on a string trial uses a
OL,11,Fcapsule attached to a thread, which is
OL,12,Fswallowed and gathers cells on a sponge
OL,13,Fas it's pulled back out of the food
OL,14,Fpipe.
OL,16,FThe procedure is "less invasive" than
OL,17,Fan endoscopy and it's considered an
OL,18,Feffective way of identifying people who
OL,19,Fare at risk of developing oesophogel
OL,20,Fcancer early, according to Dr James
OL,21,FCalvert, Deputy Chief Medical Officer
OL,22,Ffor Wales.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
