OL,3,GNEWSAPill on a string could detect
OL,4,Acancer risk in people with heartburn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are about 22 deaths a day from
OL,7,Fthe disease, which is the seventh most
OL,8,Fcommon cause of cancer deaths in the
OL,9,FUK.
